    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3112" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκεσ-τής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκεστήρ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				1052
			</span></i>: Phrygian acc. to Sch.Ven. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				22.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1254.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				51.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκεσταὶ ἱματίων ῥαγέντων</span>
			<i>menders</i> of torn clothes, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.6.16
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠπηταί</span>
			), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
